<title>USA: Data Broadcasting plans share buybacks.</title>
<headline>Data Broadcasting plans share buybacks.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Wyo. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Data Broadcasting Corp said on Tuesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to two million shares.</p>
<p>The company said it would implement the repurchases in open market or private transactions.</p>
<p>Data Broadcasting said it had about 33 million shares outstanding as of November 6.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
